{
  "description": "The contracts the frontend LEGO touches. 'own' = owned by ui-frontend; 'foreign' = owned by another LEGO/domain, reached only through the compatibility boundary; 'planned' = reserved for a LEGO that does not exist yet; 'legacy' = superseded spec kept for traceability. The frontend never imports what a foreign contract describes \u2014 it calls the REST surface that implements it.",
